source: crates/grimble-check/tests/mermaid.rs
expression: web_app()
---
### use-case: web_app

```mermaid
flowchart LR
    a_admin["admin (human)"]
    a_customer["customer (human)"]
    a_payment_gateway["payment_gateway (external)"]
    subgraph sys_web_app["web_app"]
        g_admin_manage_catalogue(["admin.manage_catalogue"])
        g_customer_browse_items(["customer.browse_items"])
        g_customer_place_order(["customer.place_order"])
        g_customer_place_order_account(["customer.place_order.account"])
        g_customer_place_order_guest(["customer.place_order.guest"])
        g_customer_track_order(["customer.track_order"])
        s_browse["scenario browse"]
        s_checkout["scenario checkout"]
    end
    a_admin --> g_admin_manage_catalogue
    a_customer --> g_customer_browse_items
    a_customer --> g_customer_place_order
    a_customer --> g_customer_track_order
    g_customer_place_order -.->|"requires"| g_customer_browse_items
    g_customer_place_order --> g_customer_place_order_account
    g_customer_place_order --> g_customer_place_order_guest
    g_customer_track_order -.->|"requires"| g_customer_place_order
    s_browse -.->|"realizes"| g_customer_browse_items
    s_checkout -.->|"realizes"| g_customer_place_order_guest
    s_checkout -.->|"realizes"| g_customer_place_order_account
```

### sequence: web_app.browse

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    title browse
    participant customer as customer
    participant system as system
    Note over customer: customer.lands
    customer->>customer: customer.navigates_to_products
    customer->>system: system.queries_products
    system-->>customer: customer.adds_to_cart
    customer->>system: system.reserves_stock
    Note over system: end ok
    alt no_item_found
        Note over system: system.suggests_alternatives
        Note over system: end ok
    else out_of_stock
        Note over system: end err(out_of_stock)
    end
```

### activity: web_app.browse

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    start(("browse"))
    n0["customer.lands"]
    start --> n0
    n1["customer.navigates_to_products"]
    n0 --> n1
    n2["system.queries_products"]
    n1 --> n2
    n3["customer.adds_to_cart"]
    n2 -->|"try"| n3
    n4["system.reserves_stock"]
    n3 --> n4
    t0(["end ok"])
    n4 --> t0
    n5["system.suggests_alternatives"]
    n2 -->|"no_item_found"| n5
    t1(["end ok"])
    n5 --> t1
    t2(["end err(out_of_stock)"])
    n4 -->|"out_of_stock"| t2
```

### sequence: web_app.checkout

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    title checkout
    participant customer as customer
    participant system as system
    Note over customer: customer.submits_cart
    customer->>system: system.shows_total
    system->>customer: customer.enters_payment
    alt declined
        loop retry max 3
            customer-->>customer: customer.enters_payment
        end
    else ok
        Note over system: system.confirms_order
        Note over system: end ok
    else timeout
        Note over customer: end err(timeout)
    end
```

### activity: web_app.checkout

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    start(("checkout"))
    n0["customer.submits_cart"]
    start --> n0
    n1["system.shows_total"]
    n0 --> n1
    n2["customer.enters_payment"]
    n1 --> n2
    n2 -->|"declined, retry max 3"| n2
    n3["system.confirms_order"]
    n2 -->|"ok"| n3
    t0(["end ok"])
    n3 --> t0
    t1(["end err(timeout)"])
    n2 -->|"timeout"| t1
```
